# Runtime state -- generated locally, contains real colleague names/emails.
# Never commit this. (The scripts write it to ~/.aster_daily_cheer/ by
# default, outside this repo, but ignore it here too as a safety net in
# case anyone copies files around.)
# known_prefixes.json is the one exception: it's just a list of validated
# 3-letter search prefixes (no names/emails), shipped so clones don't have
# to re-run full_sweep.py's random scan from scratch.
*.json
!known_prefixes.json
*.jsonl
exhausted_prefixes.json
hearted_people.json
sweep_state.json
run_log.jsonl
sweep_output.log
design_ref/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# OS
.DS_Store
